---
layout: base.njk
title: "Canadian Battlefield Tours from Paris | Heroes and Heritage Tours"
description: "Vimy Ridge, Flanders Fields, and Canada's Hundred Days: Canadian First World War battlefield tours departing central Paris, 7:30 AM from Gare du Nord."
activeNav: tours
permalink: "/tours-from-paris.html"
---

<header class="hero hero--compact">
  <div class="hero-media">
    <img src="/photos/vimy/vimy-cover.jpg" alt="The Canadian National Vimy Memorial against a blue sky" width="1800" height="1200">
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">Departing from Paris</span>
      <h1>Canadian Battlefield Tours from Paris.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Vimy Ridge, Flanders Fields, and Canada's Hundred Days, all reachable in a single day from central Paris: a 7:30 AM departure from Gare du Nord, a $100 CAD supplement on top of our Arras pricing, and a battlefield guide waiting for you the moment you step off the train in Arras.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2>Everything you need to know before you book.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="info-panel" style="position: static; max-width: 760px;" data-reveal>
      <h3>Departing Paris for the Western Front</h3>
      <ul class="info-panel-list">
        <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 10.5l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Meet at Paris Gare du Nord Train Station at 7:30 AM for the morning TGV to Arras. Your battlefield guide meets you at the main entrance of Arras station the moment you arrive.</li>
        <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 10.5l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>A flat $100 CAD supplement is added to our usual Arras pricing, to cover the return TGV fare and the earlier start.</li>
        <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 10.5l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Vimy Ridge &amp; The Somme and Canada's Hundred Days run from Paris on the same days they run from Arras. Flanders Fields &amp; Passchendaele runs Tuesdays only from Paris.</li>
        <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M3 10.5l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>You'll return to Paris Gare du Nord by approximately 8:00 PM the same day.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="body-text" style="font-size: 14px;">Every tour includes an expert, English-speaking Western Front guide, a comfortable air-conditioned minibus once in Arras, and all entry fees. Prices are quoted in CAD.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Choose your tour</span>
      <h2>Three ways to walk in their footsteps from Paris.</h2>
    </div>

    {% set parisTourDescriptions = {
      "vimy-to-victory": "Beaumont-Hamel, Courcelette and Vimy Ridge, on a full-day battlefield tour reachable in one trip from central Paris.",
      "in-flanders-fields": "Ypres and Passchendaele, including Essex Farm, Tyne Cot and the Passchendaele Museum, reachable in one trip from central Paris.",
      "somme-front": "The Canadian Corps' advance from Arras to Cambrai, including the Drocourt-Quéant Line and Canal du Nord, reachable in one trip from central Paris."
    } %}
    {% set parisTours = [] %}
    {% for tour in tours %}{% if tour.parisAvailable %}{% set noop = parisTours.push(tour) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    <div class="tours-grid" data-reveal>
      {% for tour in parisTours %}
      <article class="tour-card">
        <a href="/tours/{{ tour.slug }}.html" class="tour-card-media">
          <img src="{{ tour.cardImage }}" alt="{{ tour.cardAlt }}" width="800" height="600">
          <span class="tour-card-badge">{{ tour.badge }}</span>
        </a>
        <div class="tour-card-body">
          <h3><a href="/tours/{{ tour.slug }}.html">{{ tour.shortName }}</a></h3>
          <div class="tour-card-meta">
            <span>Departs Paris</span>
            <span>{% if tour.parisRunDays %}Tuesdays only{% else %}{{ tour.schedule }}{% endif %}</span>
            <span>{{ tour.duration }}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tour-card-desc">{{ parisTourDescriptions[tour.slug] }}</p>
          <div class="tour-card-footer">
            <div class="tour-card-price">
              <span class="amount">${{ (tour.price + 100) | currency }}</span><span class="unit">CAD / person</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/tours/{{ tour.slug }}.html" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Full Itinerary</a>
          </div>
          <a href="/book-paris.html?tour={{ tour.slug }}" class="btn btn-primary btn-block" style="margin-top: var(--space-2);">Book from Paris</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="body-text" style="text-align: center; margin-top: var(--space-4);">Prefer departing from Arras? See our <a href="/tours.html#dayTours" style="color: var(--red); font-weight: 600;">Western Front tours</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band" data-reveal>
      <h2>Not sure which tour is right for you?</h2>
      <p class="lede">Send us a message and we'll help you choose the best fit for your trip from Paris.</p>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get In Touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
